1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:02,330
(Leonard:)Okay, bug report taken.

2
00:00:02,499 --> 00:00:05,709
(Leonard:)Next time, I will have a better plan
for our evening's activity.

3
00:00:05,877 --> 00:00:07,757
(Penny:)Well, thank you. I'll see you tomorrow.

4
00:00:07,921 --> 00:00:11,421
Yeah. Oh, wait. Here. Almost forgot.

5
00:00:11,591 --> 00:00:13,221
(Leonard:)- Here.
- What's this?

6
00:00:13,384 --> 00:00:14,514
(Leonard:)My bug report to you.

7
00:00:22,185 --> 00:00:25,975
Well, it's quite a list you got there.

8
00:00:26,356 --> 00:00:28,436
It's color-coded.

9
00:00:29,943 --> 00:00:31,773
Red means "fix right away."

10
00:00:33,613 --> 00:00:36,993
Yellow is "whenever you get a chance."

11
00:00:37,534 --> 00:00:40,784
And green is "I could probably learn
to live with it."

12
00:00:41,788 --> 00:00:45,128
(Leonard:)There's a key down here at the bottom.
It's neat, huh?

13
00:00:47,085 --> 00:00:48,755
(Penny:)Yep.

14
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:52,380
(Leonard:)So have a good night.

15
00:00:54,342 --> 00:00:59,022
(Penny:)Yep.

